# LAMMPS Stage 1: Serial Soft Minimization (ATOMISTIC, CHARMM)
# pair_style soft only; the .soft settings carry the bonded terms
# with 1-4 weights 0 (CHARMM 1-4 terms need an lj/charmm pair style).

units           real
atom_style      full
boundary        p p p
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     charmm
dihedral_style  charmm
improper_style  harmonic
special_bonds   charmm
pair_style      soft 1.0

read_data       ../03_Conformation/system_relaxed.data
Reading data file ...
